===Etymology===
From {{etyl|es|en}} {{m|es|manta}}, so called because they were caught using a blanket-shaped trap called a ''manta''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|/ˈmæntəɹeɪ/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of several very large [[pelagic]] [[ray]]s of the genus ''[[Manta]]'', with winglike [[pectoral fin]]s, a long tail, and two fins resembling horns that project from the head.

